		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>Ph.</u>
			259b20
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
			2.569.19
		</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
